  "claim_short": "All four universal conjectures are false as written. Take the circle group with normalized Haar measure. Its diagonal has product measure zero, while each conjecture requires that measure to equal |mu(G)|^2/|d|, which is one when d=1. Thus the contradiction is simply 0=1, independently of every proposed vector or functional.",
